# Smart Home IoT System - Project Specification

## 🎯 Project Overview

A full-stack, production-ready Smart Home IoT System that demonstrates enterprise-level software engineering practices. This system allows users to monitor and control IoT devices in real-time through a web/mobile interface, with emphasis on scalability, security, and real-time data processing.

