## 📡 API Endpoints

### Authentication
- `POST /api/auth/register` - User registration
- `POST /api/auth/login` - User login
- `POST /api/auth/logout` - User logout
- `POST /api/auth/refresh` - Refresh access token
- `GET /api/auth/me` - Get current user

### Devices
- `GET /api/devices` - Get all devices
- `GET /api/devices/:id` - Get device by ID
- `POST /api/devices` - Register new device
- `PUT /api/devices/:id` - Update device
- `DELETE /api/devices/:id` - Delete device
- `POST /api/devices/:id/control` - Send control command

### Sensor Data
- `GET /api/sensors/:deviceId/data` - Get sensor readings
- `GET /api/sensors/:deviceId/history` - Get historical data
- `GET /api/sensors/:deviceId/stats` - Get statistics

### Rooms
- `GET /api/rooms` - Get all rooms
- `POST /api/rooms` - Create room
- `PUT /api/rooms/:id` - Update room
- `DELETE /api/rooms/:id` - Delete room

### Automation
- `GET /api/automations` - Get all automation rules
- `POST /api/automations` - Create automation
- `PUT /api/automations/:id` - Update automation
- `DELETE /api/automations/:id` - Delete automation

### Users (Admin only)
- `GET /api/users` - Get all users
- `GET /api/users/:id` - Get user by ID
- `PUT /api/users/:id` - Update user
- `DELETE /api/users/:id` - Delete user

